Did you get Mojo before the luckstone? If so any good luck
you had was draining away until you got your luckstone.
also, Mojo is the guaranteed first gift for a Valk, you can
easily get it before maximizing your luck.

Your luck can range from one to ten without the luckstone,
the luckstone adds a +3 bonus. So once you have your
luckstone you should go for ten 4 leaf clovers or two IDed
valuable gems to a aligned unicorn. Then don't break
mirrors. I think there is a small but not insignificant
chance of getting a luck penalty for killing a peaceful
monsters so don't just kill 'em all for fun. 

Then there is the great luck drain called Sokoban. Virtually
anything that avoids solving the puzzles by pushing boulders
will get you a one point luck penalty. I learned this the
hard way, squeezing by boulders to correct my mistakes. When
I finished, I encountered a couple of soldier ants and I
couldn't hit them, where I could before, DYWYPI. And
carrying an uncursed luckstone won't allow that bad luck to
wear off. 
 
